+# Plervo Canvas
 
-<h1 align="center">FigCraft</h1>
+An experimental member of Plervo Suite by AlporT.
 
-<p align="center">
-  <b>Interface design; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Figma, rebuilt in pure Rust.</b><br>
-  Frames, auto layout, components and variants, vector networks, styles, variables and prototypes,<br>
-  in a native app that opens instantly and works offline. Open source, and yours.
-</p>
+Adapted from [storytold/figcraft](https://github.com/storytold/figcraft) at `833f0d2c27f0acbae5394848930ae531fc89c724` (v0.6.0).
+Original authors, copyright notices and MIT/Apache-2.0 licenses are retained. Plervo is an independent distribution.
 
